<section class="section how-section snap-section" id="how-it-works"><div class="section-heading" data-reveal><div><span class="section-label">04 / LESS NOISE. MORE YOU.</span><h2>A simple space.<br>For a wonderfully busy mind.</h2></div><p>There’s no right way to think.<br>Just a better place to put it all.</p></div><div class="how-grid"><div class="thought-art" data-reveal><span class="thought thought-one">a sudden idea &#10023;</span><span class="thought thought-two">that thing to remember</span><span class="thought thought-three">the next big thing &#8599;</span><div class="idea-box"><span>n&#8599;</span></div><span class="box-shadow"></span></div><div class="how-list" data-reveal><article><span>01</span><div><h3>Catch it before it goes.</h3><p>A passing thought, a grand plan, a grocery list. Open a note and get it down while it’s still yours.</p></div></article><article><span>02</span><div><h3>Find a little order.</h3><p>Give your notes a name. Favorite the important ones. Find that one idea with a quick search.</p></div></article><article><span>03</span><div><h3>Make room for what’s next.</h3><p>Your notes save as you write, right in your browser. Less remembering. More being in the moment.</p></div></article></div></div></section>
